[h1][b]Sudden update and discount! Happy Halloween to you![/b][/h1]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41279156/5ffedabfd02b667b7f5517946d419cc4335c273f.png[/img]

[b]▪ The game has been ported to the new, latest version of the engine; 
▪ Updated all technical aspects of the game: 
▪ This will allow us to keep our finger on the pulse in the future and respond more quickly to challenges.[/b]

[b]▪ Fixed a rare crash in puzzles that occurred when performing a certain sequence of actions;
▪ Fixed a bug that allowed you to pass puzzles in an unfair way, using the flaws of the pause;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.[/b]


[h3][b]■ Discounts for the whole week up to 90%! Hurry up to buy the game at a bargain price:[/b][/h3]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1764810

[h1][b]SUPER EASY Crazy Fun mode update![/b][/h1]

[h3][b]▪ The ability to get ALL achievements has been added to the Easy Difficulty mode![/b][/h3]
[b]▪ Leaderboards have been added to the Easy Difficulty mode;
▪ Time counters have become available in Story mode;
▪ Time counters have been added to the Puzzle mode;
▪ In the Easy Difficulty mode, the Boss battle is simplified.[/b]

[h3][b]▪ Completely redesigned level selector for Easy difficulty mode:[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ The selector has added the ability to view the Top 5 leaders for each level;
▪ Added a link to full-fledged result tables around the world;
▪ A hint has been added to the selector.[/b]

[h3][b]▪ New Super-Easy difficulty mode for puzzles:[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ Now the puzzles are assembled by themselves, with a simple mouse click![/b]

[h3][b]▪ For the whole game:[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ Improved display of players' results in milliseconds after the decimal point, up to thousandth values;
▪ Redesigned the ending screen, added information about the next game in the series: TitTok 3[/b]

[h3][b]▪ Other: [/b][/h3]
[b]▪ Changed the description of difficulty levels, in accordance with the new update;
▪ Updating developer certificates;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.[/b]

[h3][b]▪ Many other minor changes and fixes:[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ In order not to overload the news, I will not describe minor technical and imperceptible changes to the eye. But a lot of work has been done these days. Many thanks to all those who report bugs and problems! Thank you, dear players, thanks to you the game is getting better![/b]

[h1][b]Try our new game:[/b][/h1]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/2003220/TitTok_3/

[h3][b]Write about bugs and errors on the forum, I will fix everything: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/1764810/discussions/0/3193619890125370352/]Bugs and other problems[/url][/b][/h3]
[h3][b]A live support chat with the developer is also available: [url=https://s.team/chat/Y5SG9zpR]TitTok Live Support[/url][/b][/h3]
